Vercel Speed Insights Installation - Implementation Report
===========================================================

Summary:
--------
Successfully installed and configured Vercel Speed Insights for this React + Vite project following the official Vercel documentation.

Changes Made:
-------------

1. Package Installation:
   - Installed @vercel/speed-insights package (v1.1.0)
   - Updated package.json with the new dependency
   - Updated package-lock.json with all dependency resolutions

2. Code Configuration:
   Modified: app/src/App.tsx
