Implementation Details:
-----------------------
Framework: React 19.2.0 with Vite 7.2.4
Package Manager: npm
Documentation Source: https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart

The SpeedInsights component was added following the official React/Vite instructions from Vercel's documentation. The component is placed in the main App component to ensure it's loaded across all routes and pages.

